7
00:02:06,322 --> 00:02:09,912
When those notes fall upon your ears, where will they take you?

8
00:02:11,452 --> 00:02:14,652
Listen well, destiny beckons.

9
00:02:56,350 --> 00:02:59,850
ララライ ララライ 誰も知らない名も無い今を 駆けて行くの
Lalalai, lalalai... Racing through an unnamed present that nobody knows

10
