22
00:04:04,150 --> 00:04:07,750
ララライ ララライ 君を知りたい 何一つ見逃さぬように
Lalalai, lalalai... Wanting to know you so as not to miss a single thing

23
00:04:08,150 --> 00:04:12,150
時は誰も待ってくれないの
Time waits for no one

24
00:04:12,650 --> 00:04:16,450
残酷な運命が 抗えぬ宿命が
A cruel destiny, an unresistable fate

25
00:04:16,650 --> 00:04:20,150
考える間もなく 押し寄せ砂嵐で
Pushing in as a sandstorm before we even have time to think

26
00:04:20,350 --> 00:04:27,550
前が見えなくたって 君を信じてみたいの 恐れずに一歩踏み出したら
Even if I can't see ahead, I want to try believing in you, if I take a step forward without fear

