さぁ 皆さんこちらへ どうぞ鼓動の鳴る方へ
Come on everyone, right this way, toward where the heartbeat sounds

30
00:04:39,650 --> 00:04:43,650
さぁ 踵を打ち鳴らせ どうぞ心の踊る方へ
Stamp your heels, right this way, toward where your heart dances

31
