315
00:43:47,446 --> 00:43:56,466
いつもどおり君は嫌われ者だ なんにもせずとも遠ざけられて 努力をしてみるけど
As usual, you're disliked by everyone, kept at a distance without even doing anything, even though you try your best.

316
00:43:57,496 --> 00:44:06,076
その理由なんて「なんとなく？」で 君は途方に暮れて悲しんでた
For no reason other than "just because?", you were lost and grieving.

