Well, then you can just use my voice! Though some might find it incomprehensible, a harsh, grating, terrible voice...

318
00:44:16,336 --> 00:44:26,716
きっと君の力になれる だからあたしを歌わせてみて そう君の 君だけの言葉でさ
I'm sure I can be of help to you. So let me sing! With your, your very own words, come on!

319
00:44:31,316 --> 00:44:41,346
綴って連ねて あたしがその思想（コトバ）を叫ぶから 描いて理想を その思いは誰にも触れさせない
Spell it out, string it together, since I will shout that thought! Paint your ideal, and I won't let anyone touch those feelings.

320
00:44:41,936 --> 00:44:51,526
ガラクタの声はそして響く ありのままを不器用に繋いで 目一杯に 大声を上げる
Let the voice of junk resound, connecting your true self clumsily, raising a loud voice with all your might!

321
00:44:51,966 --> 00:44:59,564
ガラクタの声はそして響く ありのままを不器用に繋いで 目一杯に 大声を上げる
Let the voice of junk resound, connecting your true self clumsily, raising a loud voice with all your might!

322
00:45:00,144 --> 00:45:01,624
