君の後ろで誰かが言う「虎の威を借る狐のくせに！」
Behind you, someone says, "You're just a fox borrowing a tiger's might!"

331
00:45:37,144 --> 00:45:41,444
ねぇ、君は一人で泣いてたんだね
Hey, you were crying all by yourself, weren't you?

332
00:45:46,504 --> 00:45:49,964
聴こえる？この声
Can you hear this voice?

333
00:45:50,124 --> 00:45:55,744
あたしがその言葉をかき消すから
I will drown out those words,

334
00:45:56,584 --> 00:46:05,724
